mailbag-folder-inbox-symbolic.svg
Author: Jakub Steiner (GNOME)
License: CC0-1.0, as the file's own metadata states (see
LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt in the source tree)
Source: the icon `inbox` of the GNOME icon-development-kit
(https://gitlab.gnome.org/Teams/Design/icon-development-kit), as the Icon
Library application 0.0.23 ships it
Changes: the file name gives it an application-specific name, and its path
carries the classes `transparent-fill foreground-stroke`, so that GTK's icon
theme draws the outline as the source means it instead of filling it.

